# 13 - Drawing a picture with shapes

make window art titled "A sunny day" sized 640 by 460
add canvas board to art sized 620 by 420 background "sky"

# ground and sun
draw rectangle on board at 0, 320 size 620 by 100 color "grass"
draw circle at 540, 80 size 45 color "sun"
draw ring at 540, 80 size 58 color "gold" width 4

# a house
draw rectangle at 120, 210 size 160 by 110 color "beige" outline "saddlebrown" width 3
draw triangle at 200, 175 size 190 color "firebrick"
draw rectangle at 180, 260 size 40 by 60 color "saddlebrown"
draw square at 135, 235 size 30 color "lightblue" outline "white" width 3
draw square at 235, 235 size 30 color "lightblue" outline "white" width 3

# clouds, stars, a heart and some text
for each spot in [[90, 70], [300, 50], [400, 110]]
    draw ellipse at spot[1], spot[2] size 90 by 40 color "white"
    draw ellipse at spot[1] + 30, spot[2] - 12 size 60 by 34 color "white"
end
draw heart at 420, 260 size 50
draw star at 360, 200 size 18 color "gold" angle 15
draw line from 300, 330 to 600, 330 color "darkgreen" width 3 dashed
draw arrow from 470, 380 to 560, 380 color "navy" width 4
draw text at 310, 395 saying "Made with Memowrite" size 18 bold color "darkgreen"

export board to "sunny_day.png"
export board to "sunny_day.svg"
say "Saved the picture as sunny_day.png and sunny_day.svg"
